# Build context for the two images built from this repository: the serving
# image (Dockerfile; reads pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE.md and
# src/) and the agent demo (examples/agent_demo/Dockerfile; also the demo).
# Everything else -- local virtualenvs especially -- would bloat or break
# reproducible builds.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!src/
!examples/agent_demo/
examples/agent_demo/workspace/
examples/agent_demo/answers/
examples/agent_demo/runs/
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
